  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADD - For The Sake of Family</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project envisions that men, women and youth in 83 urban poor slums in Bangalore and Hyderabad cities are well-informed of the harmful effects of alcohol and substance abuse. It will lobby with the state governments of Karnataka and Telangana on liquor policies to ensure that amendments to the excise policies of both states reflect strengthened mechanisms to regulate alcohol distribution and sales. Awareness programs will help to reduce alcohol-related GBV in families and communities.</narrative>
  </description>
